            "title": "Judge Greenlights Offshore Wind Farm After Trump Halt",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Danish company  Orsted  won a court ruling on Monday to restart work on an offshore wind project near Rhode Island\u2014the first dent in a moratorium on all offshore wind projects that the Trump administration issued last month.  Orsted said construction on its Revolution Wind project was 87% complete when the Interior Department suddenly issued a stop work order for all offshore wind projects on Dec. 22, citing national security concerns.  The $5 billion project was expected to start generating power as soon as this month, and produce enough electricity for 350,000 homes in Rhode Island and Connecticut.",
